{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>I shall strike them with plague.</b> As in: וְגַם יַד ה׳ הָיְתָה בָם לְהֻמָּם מִקֶּרֶב הַמַּחֲנֶה עַד תֻּמָּם (Deuteronomy 2:15)." "<b>And I shall dispossess them.</b> I shall bring it about that they leave their substance to others, who shall inherit it — as in the case where the dead inherit from the living (Bava Batra, chapter יש נוחלין), which occurred in the division of the land. And thereby He fulfilled what He had sworn to those who came out of Egypt, saying (Exodus 6:8): וְנָתַתִּי אוֹתָהּ לָכֶם מוֹרָשָׁה."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:47.343427193Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}